  "description": "XIVZOS crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C84 H96 Gd4 N50 O40 2+,6(H3 O1 1+),8(Cl1 1-),36(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Gd1 (Gd) has 9 O neighbors; Gd2 (Gd) has 9 O neighbors; Gd3 (Gd) has 9 O neighbors; Gd4 (Gd) has 9 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.724-3.907 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 88.71-110.82°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C84H186Cl8Gd4N50O82.",
